From 65cd47c3d3abf2b2f48240666358324d29448ea3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:58:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add direct storefront endpoints to bypass App Proxy challenge

Shopify's edge returns 429 + Cloudflare challenge on /apps/wowsticker/*
fetches, so draft/rates/price never reach the backend. Add /storefront/*
routes that check Origin, rate-limit per IP, sign the request server-side
and reuse the existing proxy actions unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ApvooPpDzqNZFtVVRPUCgw
